{"id":"n64366-1-42","stage":3,"title":"견디다 · 经得住","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64366-1-42-1","ko":"나는 더위는 잘 참는데 추위는 잘 못 견뎌.","zh":"我比较能忍受热，但实在受不了冷。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"더위는","meaning":"热，暑热","explanation":"더위：热，暑热；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"더위","audio":"/audio/34336435fffc87890da8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47399","senseId":"1","lemma":"더위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더위는","audio":"/audio/2b2cc2e820e13f9b2d7c.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"经常","explanation":"잘：经常","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"9","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"참는데","meaning":"忍受，忍耐","explanation":"참다：忍受，忍耐；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"참다","audio":"/audio/1cfaf7914b38f877c7e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29772","senseId":"3","lemma":"참다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참는데","audio":"/audio/d11ab1495a0995cc3752.mp3"}},{"text":"추위는","meaning":"寒冷，冷","explanation":"추위：寒冷，冷；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"추위","audio":"/audio/bd2cd1495e00ab524a5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72135","senseId":"1","lemma":"추위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"추위는","audio":"/audio/1313d0024e3f55886da1.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"经常","explanation":"잘：经常","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"9","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"견뎌.","meaning":"经得住，硬挺，忍耐","explanation":"견디다：经得住，硬挺，忍耐；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"견디다","audio":"/audio/3d2b0fdac042ddf03a36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64366","senseId":"1","lemma":"견디다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"견뎌","audio":"/audio/de836642140adcd54817.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"34336435fffc8789","term":"더위","zh":"热，暑热","audio":"/audio/34336435fffc87890da8.mp3","entryId":"47399","definition":"夏季的暑气；炎热的天气。","pronunciation":["더위"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"经常","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"习惯性地、常常。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"1cfaf7914b38f877","term":"참다","zh":"忍受，忍耐","audio":"/audio/1cfaf7914b38f877c7e3.mp3","entryId":"29772","definition":"即使艰难困苦也能挺过去。","pronunciation":["참ː따"]},{"id":"bd2cd1495e00ab52","term":"추위","zh":"寒冷，冷","audio":"/audio/bd2cd1495e00ab524a5e.mp3","entryId":"72135","definition":"主要指冬季的寒气或冷天气。","pronunciation":["추위"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"3d2b0fdac042ddf0","term":"견디다","zh":"经得住，硬挺，忍耐","audio":"/audio/3d2b0fdac042ddf03a36.mp3","entryId":"64366","definition":"在辛苦困难面前忍受坚持并生活下去。","pronunciation":["견디다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4e42922ab0476fd61753.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64366-1-42-2","ko":"나도 나이 드니까 추위는 못 참겠더라.","zh":"我也年纪大了，越来越受不了冷了。